WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.167
-I want to know if you want to
play a new game

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.434
called "SongMojis."
Here we go.

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:07.767
-♪ Let me see those SongMojis ♪

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:09.434
-♪ Baby ♪

00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:10.534
-Here's how this works.

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:12.434
We're gonna be shown
a string of emojis

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:14.100
that represent a song title.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.033
The first person to hit
this buzzer right here

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:17.667
with the correct title
gets a point.

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:19.167
We'll play five rounds.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:21.234
Each round is harder and harder
and worth more points.

00:00:21.234 --> 00:00:22.367
-Whoa.
-You ready for this?

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:23.801
-Whoa!
-Here we go.

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:26.567
Let's see our first SongMoji.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.000
-I'm focused.
-Oh.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.267
-What! Wait.
[ Beeping ]

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:30.868
Guys, there is actually
a problem.

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:33.067
I can't see that far.
-I have an advantage.

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:34.300
-I'm gonna have to
come really close.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.400
-That's alright.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.868
-Should we, both of us,
just come closer?

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:37.934
-Yeah, of course.
-I'm sorry.

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:39.000
I actually can't see that far.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.200
-Before we come closer,

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.267
I'm gonna need to take points
for that one.

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:42.634
It's "Watermelon Sugar."
-Okay, see?

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:43.634
That's "Watermelon Sugar."
-It's Harry.

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:45.133
[ Ding ]

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.634
-Okay, now I can see.

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:49.133
Sorry. Yeah.
-Alright, here we go.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:50.868
Round 2. This is harder.
-Okay.

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:53.601
Oh, car -- drive --
[ Beeping ]

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:54.601
"drivers license."

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:57.167
-Oh, my gosh! Hey! Nice!
-Yeah.

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:59.067
Now I can see.
-I'm rooting for you.

00:00:59.067 --> 00:01:00.701
-I definitely need glasses.
-Yeah, no, it's alright.

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:01.734
Here we go. Me too.

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:03.400
-Oh, "Walking on Sunshine."

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.868
[ Beeping ]
-Gosh!

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:06.601
Hold on!
[ Ding ]

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:09.601
All right, hold on.
Here we go. Next one.

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:11.634
-Airplane --
Number-1 airplane --

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:12.934
-Oh, "First Class,"
"First Class."

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:14.167
-"First Class."
Oh, that's...

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:16.534
-"Number-1 Airplane."

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:17.701
Alright, here we go.
Is this it?

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:19.601
Is this the final one?

00:01:19.601 --> 00:01:23.267
-Thumbs-up, good -- good --
good prayer.

00:01:23.267 --> 00:01:24.767
"Living on a Prayer."
-Good letter.

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:26.033
-Good letter...

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:29.734
Praying on a thumb.
-Up?

00:01:29.734 --> 00:01:31.167
-Finger on the thumb.
-Yes.

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:33.901
-"Shape of You."
-Yes and please.

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:34.934
-Yes --
-Yes and thank you.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:36.601
-Wait.
-Please and thank you.

00:01:36.601 --> 00:01:40.534
-Good job. Good "A."
Good "A." Shape "A."

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:43.534
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.133
-What?!
-What?

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:46.234
"Like a Prayer."
-"Like a Prayer!"

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:47.334
No, you --
♪♪

00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:50.868
-"Like a Prayer."
Oh, my God. Oh, my God.

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:51.934
-You pressed the buzzer.

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:53.167
Camila Cabello, everybody.

00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:55.634
